config BR2_PACKAGE_PRISMLAUNCHER
    bool "prismlauncher"
    depends on BR2_x86_64
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_XORG7
    select BR2_PACKAGE_XDOTOOL
    select BR2_PACKAGE_MINECRAFT_MANAGER if BR2_PACKAGE_QT6  # Manage Minecraft
    help
      Prism Launcher, the backend of the Minecraft system.

      Ships the upstream AppImage plus batocera-minecraft, which
      launches Single Player, Split Screen, Manage Minecraft and the
      Prism window, and batocera-minecraft-mods (Modrinth mods for P1
      and P2).

      https://prismlauncher.org
